  "ruleText": "Env-A 3803.01 Prior Registrations. The department shall retain records of all voluntary emissions reductions (VER) registered with the department under this chapter as in effect prior to the chapter’s 2009 effective date.\n\nSource. #7456, eff 2-24-01; ss by #9393, INTERIM, eff 2-24-09, EXPIRES: 8-24-09; ss by#9470, eff 5-16-09",
